"P3847659604" "Interesting. This device you found in the Vahzilok den is just like the one you discovered in the Clockwork hideout. {HeroName}, I don't think they were designed by the Clockwork King at all! I believe Vahzilok's been using these devices to communicate with his minions; the Clockwork probably just took it for scrap.<br><br>It looks like we're no nearer to figuring out how the Clockwork King powers his robots. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you collect some more Clockwork parts for me?</A> I'd like to see if I can recreate the robots in my lab."
// AcceptString :
"P3293598481" "Collect more Clockwork parts"
// SendOffString :
"P498620881" "About 15 should do it, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2896085091" "Collect sample parts"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3880709986" "I need more Clockwork parts, {HeroName}. Get back on the streets."

