// IntroString :
"P2151619805" "Help! They're in my lab! The Clockwork King's robots! Believe it or not, {HeroName}, they're the same defunct robots you collected for me earlier. I don't know how it happened, but they're somehow functioning again!<br><br>I've sealed them in, but they'll get out eventually. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to destroy the Clockwork and recover the research data from my computer.</A> Hurry, before they destroy it! The location of my lab is marked on your map."
